<title>JAPAN: Kyushu Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kyushu Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    20.56		vs	   24.72</p>
<p> Operating	    4.65		vs	    4.85</p>
<p> Current		1.96		vs	    1.79</p>
<p> Net		     1.9		vs	  594    million</p>
<p> EPS		   19.56 yen	  vs	    6.13 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     97 million	  vs	  97 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kyushu Bank Ltd is a regional bank based in Nagasaki prefecture.</p>
</text>
